WEBVTT

00:02.420 --> 00:05.810
This forest is also known 
as the Darkness of Llinger.

00:05.810 --> 00:08.660
It's infamously teeming with monsters.

00:09.080 --> 00:13.100
Don't come back until you 
hunt down a grand grizzly.

00:13.100 --> 00:13.710
Huh?!

00:13.710 --> 00:14.990
H-H-H-Hang on a minute!

00:14.990 --> 00:17.710
Wait, no! Stop! Don't lift me up!

00:18.710 --> 00:21.850
A-And don't wind up!

00:28.540 --> 00:31.710
<i>Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap!
I'm gonna die at this rate!</i>

00:31.710 --> 00:34.870
<i>Cause of death: thrown by 
the Rescue Team captain!</i>

00:31.710 --> 00:34.880
<b>Pitiful! A subordinate...</b>

00:31.710 --> 00:34.880
The victim, Usato, falls to his death in the Darkness of Llinger

00:31.710 --> 00:34.880
<b>Culprit: Rose</b>

00:35.100 --> 00:37.300
<i>This really isn't funny!</i>

00:43.300 --> 00:47.520
Like hell I'm gonna die!

00:50.940 --> 00:52.270
I'm alive...

00:52.720 --> 00:54.610
Thank goodness.

00:55.400 --> 00:58.960
But now that I'm here in the forest...

00:58.960 --> 01:03.780
I hate to admit it, but I can't go 
back until I do as Rose ordered.

01:07.980 --> 01:09.150
Okay!

01:09.150 --> 01:11.710
I'll take down a grand grizzly!

01:11.710 --> 01:13.920
It's just a two-meter-tall bear.

01:13.920 --> 01:16.540
Should be a piece of cake after the hell I've—

01:16.920 --> 01:18.960
<i>You gotta be kidding!</i>

01:33.530 --> 01:38.200
<i>The Wrong Way to Use Healing Magic</i>

02:49.100 --> 02:53.190
#3 Brutal! The Darkness of Llinger!

02:55.410 --> 02:56.520
<i>It's chasing me!</i>

02:56.520 --> 02:58.390
<i>And it's way bigger than I thought!</i>

02:58.390 --> 03:01.030
<i>Its claws and fangs are hella huge!</i>

03:01.480 --> 03:04.360
<i>However, I have confidence in my legs!</i>

03:05.540 --> 03:08.540
<i>Does a bear really think 
it can match my speed?!</i>

03:08.540 --> 03:09.750
<i>He's right on me!</i>

03:10.080 --> 03:12.040
<i>No, come on. Think about it.</i>

03:12.040 --> 03:14.910
<i>I've survived the training 
from hell all this time!</i>

03:14.910 --> 03:17.170
<i>This guy's nothing compared to Rose!</i>

03:19.020 --> 03:21.260
Bring it on, you big teddy bear!

03:21.260 --> 03:22.500
Fight me one-on-one—

03:25.590 --> 03:27.770
Ganging up on someone is cowardly!

03:28.130 --> 03:31.440
<i>Blue grizzlies are joining in on this, too?!</i>

03:33.050 --> 03:34.300
<i>That sound!</i>

04:03.490 --> 04:06.780
Man, that sucked.

04:07.180 --> 04:11.900
Emergency rations, a canteen, and a knife...

04:13.040 --> 04:17.170
At least give me something 
I can start a fire with, Rose.

04:17.580 --> 04:18.700
Is she a demon?

04:18.700 --> 04:22.370
<i>Nah, she's more like an ogre!</i>

04:22.860 --> 04:25.290
<i>I have to take down a grand grizzly...</i>

04:25.290 --> 04:27.780
<i>That's feeling like an impossible task.</i>

04:32.320 --> 04:35.120
<i>Well, I'll think about that tomorrow.</i>

04:35.940 --> 04:39.000
For starters, I've survived my first day.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.670
I should get going.

05:03.370 --> 05:06.610
<i>I need to learn more about my enemy.</i>

05:07.020 --> 05:09.580
<i>First, I need to find out 
where the grand grizzly lives.</i>

05:17.040 --> 05:19.120
<i>Traces of scratching...</i>

05:19.120 --> 05:20.730
<i>It might be the bears.</i>

05:20.730 --> 05:22.510
<i>Could they be nearby?</i>

05:35.810 --> 05:37.130
A rabbit?

05:37.130 --> 05:39.760
No, a monster that looks like a rabbit?

05:44.480 --> 05:46.700
Are you hurt?

05:47.690 --> 05:50.570
<i>It understands me? No way, right?</i>

05:50.570 --> 05:51.910
Let me see.

05:59.170 --> 06:00.550
All better.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.210
Try not to get hurt again, okay?

06:14.520 --> 06:19.230
Don't follow me! I'm looking for some 
really scary monsters right now.

06:19.230 --> 06:21.090
You'll be in danger if you're with me.

06:30.820 --> 06:32.370
I'm telling you no!

06:33.720 --> 06:37.680
Or could it be that you know 
where the grand grizzly is?

06:45.260 --> 06:47.060
Wait, really?

06:54.910 --> 06:57.000
<i>It actually knew.</i>

06:57.000 --> 06:58.840
<i>That cave must be their den.</i>

06:59.210 --> 07:02.640
<i>Okay, I'll have to monitor them 
without being discovered.</i>

07:03.530 --> 07:05.710
<i>It looks like they're a family.</i>

07:05.710 --> 07:11.580
<i>I read that grand grizzlies live in groups.
Is that what you'd call this?</i>

07:14.270 --> 07:15.750
Shh!

07:18.240 --> 07:21.850
<i>I'm a little worried about drinking 
water that hasn't been boiled, but...</i>

07:22.250 --> 07:23.790
<i>What choice do I have?</i>

07:27.160 --> 07:28.030
Huh?

07:28.030 --> 07:31.620
I thought you left. You came back?

07:32.420 --> 07:36.760
What a weird little guy. 
I'm just monitoring them again.

07:38.160 --> 07:40.320
<i>Nothing out of the ordinary.</i>

07:40.550 --> 07:43.730
<i>I'm starting to feel like the 
blue grizzlies are kinda cute.</i>

07:44.520 --> 07:47.180
<i>This black rabbit is super cute, too.</i>

07:47.180 --> 07:49.910
<i>I'm actually living a pretty 
happy life right now.</i>

07:52.370 --> 07:54.430
My stomach hurts...

07:54.430 --> 07:57.160
It must've been the water...

07:57.500 --> 08:00.840
<i>Even healing magic doesn't 
make it better right away.</i>

08:00.840 --> 08:03.590
<i>Because I was basically poisoned, I guess.</i>

08:04.100 --> 08:07.290
<i>But there has to be a way to fix this...</i>

08:08.540 --> 08:10.960
You came back again?

08:10.960 --> 08:13.310
I sure am glad to see you, though.

08:17.580 --> 08:20.510
The water here is safe?

08:21.450 --> 08:25.590
Well, it does look clearer 
than the river water.

08:29.270 --> 08:31.140
Yeah, it's delicious!

08:31.140 --> 08:32.350
Thanks...

08:33.460 --> 08:35.280
Hey, what's wrong?

08:46.810 --> 08:50.120
<i>A monster is getting closer?</i>

08:50.710 --> 08:54.890
<i>But this little guy wasn't even 
that scared of the grand grizzly...</i>

09:16.350 --> 09:18.680
<i>What the hell is that thing?</i>

09:19.960 --> 09:23.120
<i>I didn't read about anything like that.</i>

09:23.910 --> 09:26.360
<i>But still, I can tell...</i>

09:27.500 --> 09:29.210
<i>That thing is dangerous.</i>

09:29.210 --> 09:31.940
<i>There's bloodlust oozing 
from every inch of it.</i>

09:31.940 --> 09:34.290
<i>Better make sure I don't 
go anywhere near that.</i>

09:40.620 --> 09:43.130
<i>It's been four days since I saw 
the giant snake monster.</i>

09:43.480 --> 09:47.300
<i>I haven't been able to shake
this uneasy feeling inside me.</i>

09:47.300 --> 09:50.490
<i>I've just kept to observing the grand grizzly.</i>

09:53.660 --> 09:55.500
<i>These guys are the same as ever.</i>

09:55.500 --> 09:57.210
<i>Watching them warms my heart.</i>

09:57.940 --> 10:02.740
<i>But I can't go home without 
defeating that grand grizzly.</i>

10:05.220 --> 10:07.790
<i>I have to do it.</i>

10:08.740 --> 10:10.180
<i>I'll challenge it tomorrow.</i>

10:12.760 --> 10:15.900
Huh? What? I shouldn't go?

10:18.600 --> 10:20.500
Yeah, I hear you, but...

10:23.270 --> 10:24.670
All right.

10:24.670 --> 10:28.270
I'll stay until the rain stops. 
Is that good enough?

10:33.800 --> 10:35.050
Okay!

10:35.340 --> 10:37.220
<i>Better watch out, grand grizzly.</i>

10:37.220 --> 10:39.230
<i>I'm kicking your butt today.</i>

10:41.070 --> 10:46.650
You can't stop me. I need to defeat 
the bear and get out of this forest.

11:01.890 --> 11:02.930
Right.

11:04.190 --> 11:05.240
Huh?

11:08.010 --> 11:11.750
Wh-What the hell happened here?

11:14.370 --> 11:15.770
This is bad.

11:15.770 --> 11:17.650
Rose is gonna kill me...

11:18.210 --> 11:21.440
when she finds out I let something
 steal my quarry.

11:26.260 --> 11:27.960
<i>Those bite marks...</i>

11:28.660 --> 11:30.480
<i>It was probably that big snake.</i>

11:32.390 --> 11:35.510
<i>But it clearly wasn't killing to eat.</i>

11:35.960 --> 11:40.420
<i>It killed for fun,
purely for the sake of killing.</i>

11:57.280 --> 11:59.570
<i>I hate to lose.</i>

12:00.300 --> 12:02.730
<i>That's why I hate losing to Rose.</i>

12:04.070 --> 12:09.890
<i>I also hate that my quarry was stolen from 
me and I steeled my nerve for nothing.</i>

12:11.310 --> 12:13.050
<i>But most of all...</i>

12:18.530 --> 12:22.470
<i>I hate what I'm seeing right now!</i>

12:25.170 --> 12:26.330
I'll get revenge for you.

12:28.260 --> 12:29.440
So just wait there.

12:34.140 --> 12:38.020
<i>The Wrong Way to Use Healing Magic</i>

12:38.770 --> 12:41.560
Huh? He's training in the forest?

12:41.560 --> 12:45.250
Yeah. He's been gone for about ten days.

12:45.250 --> 12:47.730
Ten days?! Isn't that a bit long?

12:47.730 --> 12:51.060
It's the boss who decides everything, so...

12:51.060 --> 12:52.240
Right?

12:53.080 --> 12:56.590
Th-The boss is gone, too, 
so we don't know what's going on.

13:00.580 --> 13:04.520
Kazuki-kun, you get awfully worked
 up when it comes to Usato-kun.

13:04.520 --> 13:08.790
Huh? I mean, aren't you 
worried about him, too, Senpai?

13:08.790 --> 13:12.410
Well, I can't honestly say I'm not worried...

13:12.410 --> 13:16.940
But if Rose-san is the one making
him do this, it's probably fine.

13:18.190 --> 13:19.860
You think so?

13:19.860 --> 13:23.700
Besides, I believe in Usato-kun.

13:23.700 --> 13:26.020
I'm sure he'll come back hale and hearty.

13:26.020 --> 13:29.790
I believe in him, too...

13:42.480 --> 13:45.510
Will you take me to that snake?

13:47.420 --> 13:51.590
You can just show me the way.
Run away after that.

14:15.870 --> 14:18.570
I told that cub to stay put!

14:21.240 --> 14:23.700
<i>I knew this thing was really dangerous.</i>

14:23.700 --> 14:24.910
<i>It's terrifying!</i>

14:25.640 --> 14:26.780
<i>But even so...</i>

14:27.370 --> 14:33.840
There's nothing scarier than Rose!

14:35.270 --> 14:37.230
<i>It's confused! Now's my chance!</i>

14:39.590 --> 14:41.110
<i>That was close!</i>

14:41.360 --> 14:43.200
<i>But I've got it this time!</i>

14:43.450 --> 14:46.270
Take this, you stupid snake!

14:53.180 --> 14:55.390
Is that all you've got?

14:57.650 --> 14:59.740
It didn't do a thing to me.

15:01.760 --> 15:05.250
<i>I should attack from its right
 side, where it's blinded!</i>

15:13.880 --> 15:14.770
Wha?!

15:17.300 --> 15:19.480
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

15:19.760 --> 15:22.640
<i>It baited me into attacking its blind spot?!</i>

15:22.640 --> 15:24.040
<i>I was tricked!</i>

15:25.440 --> 15:26.320
But...

15:28.490 --> 15:33.940
I was holding my knife with that hand!

15:42.820 --> 15:43.680
Wha...

15:47.280 --> 15:48.550
Poison?

15:48.920 --> 15:52.490
It's not fair that you're both
 huge <i>and</i> venomous.

15:54.050 --> 15:57.450
<i>But I know how to heal myself!</i>

15:57.880 --> 16:00.560
<i>I learned how after getting that stomachache.</i>

16:00.930 --> 16:04.170
<i>When poison is damaging me on the inside,</i>

16:04.770 --> 16:07.860
<i>I just have to heal from the inside out!</i>

16:13.990 --> 16:14.850
You!

16:17.740 --> 16:19.020
Got it!

16:22.770 --> 16:26.340
You think that's enough to throw me off?

16:26.340 --> 16:29.700
What a dumbass!

16:40.400 --> 16:43.940
This ends now!

16:46.450 --> 16:49.600
Die!

17:12.360 --> 17:13.700
We did it...

17:23.330 --> 17:25.770
I got revenge for you.

17:26.130 --> 17:32.830
I want to heal your wounds, but I'm using 
up all my mana to neutralize the venom.

17:33.490 --> 17:35.520
I can't move anymore.

17:40.470 --> 17:42.420
No way...

17:45.810 --> 17:47.910
Stop! Run away!

17:49.820 --> 17:51.020
<i>This is it.</i>

17:51.020 --> 17:53.860
<i>Kazuki, Inukami-senpai, Rose...</i>

17:54.670 --> 17:57.630
<i>That's right. This is all Rose's fault!</i>

17:59.050 --> 18:02.480
Shit! Rose, you brute! You violent woman!

18:02.480 --> 18:05.230
You ogre!

18:12.720 --> 18:16.280
Damn, what a dirty piece of shit this snake is.

18:16.890 --> 18:19.960
You should have just died quietly.

18:20.980 --> 18:22.990
C-Captain Rose!

18:24.670 --> 18:26.190
Wait, why are you here?

18:26.680 --> 18:29.040
This little one filled me in.

18:30.070 --> 18:31.010
Huh?

18:31.490 --> 18:32.980
This is Kukuru.

18:31.500 --> 18:36.670
SMUG

18:32.980 --> 18:36.210
It's my pet. I asked it to watch over you.

18:36.670 --> 18:40.050
But it showed up injured...

18:40.840 --> 18:42.330
What a sucker.

18:42.330 --> 18:46.430
It put on an act to gain your trust.

18:47.150 --> 18:48.520
No way...

18:49.860 --> 18:54.970
I was nearby, ready to step in 
if something happened to you.

18:54.970 --> 18:57.760
I planned to intervene as little as possible,

18:58.560 --> 19:01.450
but who knew that thing would appear?

19:01.450 --> 19:03.360
You know this monster?

19:03.360 --> 19:06.430
It was created by the Demon Lord's army.

19:06.430 --> 19:10.410
Siglis failed to finish it off 
during the last invasion.

19:10.410 --> 19:12.880
It must've fled into this forest.

19:13.370 --> 19:17.910
But I didn't expect it
 to kill that grand grizzly.

19:18.330 --> 19:23.390
They're strong enough that even a full unit 
of elite troops can't take them down.

19:23.850 --> 19:28.970
Huh?! You wanted a novice like me 
to fight something like that?!

19:28.970 --> 19:31.310
<i>Witch! Monster!</i>

19:31.310 --> 19:33.830
I never expected you to win.

19:33.830 --> 19:37.500
The goal was to gain experience fighting 
something much stronger than you.

19:38.020 --> 19:38.990
However...

19:39.520 --> 19:40.310
However?

19:41.220 --> 19:45.330
Things started getting really 
interesting with you.

19:45.330 --> 19:48.070
I let you keep going to 
see what would happen.

19:48.070 --> 19:51.010
I almost died, though!

19:52.500 --> 19:53.450
Hmm?

19:53.450 --> 19:56.180
Has this guy taken a liking to you?

19:56.180 --> 19:58.130
Huh? Has it?

19:58.560 --> 20:02.720
<i>Come to think of it, 
this cub has lost its parents.</i>

20:02.720 --> 20:04.510
<i>It's all alone.</i>

20:14.620 --> 20:17.460
As I thought, you're a lot like me.

20:18.030 --> 20:19.810
Hey, blue grizzly.

20:20.510 --> 20:22.230
We're taking you with us.

20:22.230 --> 20:24.300
You'll carry this loser who couldn't even die.

20:30.880 --> 20:34.750
Wait, you're okay with this? Are you sure?

20:40.450 --> 20:42.700
Okay, let's go home.

20:44.560 --> 20:46.880
<i>I hate this. She's so freaking scary.</i>

20:47.800 --> 20:51.170
By the way, what was it you called me earlier?

20:51.630 --> 20:54.800
A brute? A violent woman? An ogre?

20:54.800 --> 20:57.740
Huh?! Oh, um...

20:57.820 --> 21:01.400
RUMBLE

20:58.560 --> 21:01.400
Don't think you'll be 
getting any sleep tonight.

21:01.400 --> 21:04.070
SHIVER
SHAKE

21:02.380 --> 21:03.190
Yes, ma'am!

21:05.670 --> 21:08.910
Well, you passed this time.

21:08.910 --> 21:10.660
With flying colors, even.

21:11.700 --> 21:14.090
You qualified today.

21:14.390 --> 21:15.570
Qualified?

21:16.090 --> 21:19.400
To stand beside me on the battlefield.

21:19.400 --> 21:23.750
You still haven't mastered the basics,
 but you've got what it takes.

21:24.090 --> 21:27.400
The ability to withstand the pain,
the physical aptitude,

21:27.400 --> 21:30.620
and a strong mental state.

21:31.590 --> 21:35.760
The other two healers never
 earned that distinction.

21:36.770 --> 21:37.980
You should be proud.

21:40.050 --> 21:42.270
We might make it at this rate.

21:42.660 --> 21:44.050
Make it for what?

21:44.670 --> 21:47.960
The demon army will be attacking soon.

21:50.160 --> 21:54.170
Amila Vergrett, commander of the third army...

21:54.170 --> 21:54.790
Sire.

21:55.880 --> 21:59.430
How go the preparations to 
invade the Llinger Kingdom?

21:59.430 --> 22:00.940
Proceeding smoothly.

22:01.550 --> 22:05.550
Our units have finished preparing for battle.

22:06.490 --> 22:09.570
We shall soon begin our advance.
